### List all products
GET http://localhost:8090/shop/products
### Get a single product by id
GET http://localhost:8090/shop/products/1
### Get a product that does not exist (expect 404)
GET http://localhost:8090/shop/products/999
### Place an order
POST http://localhost:8090/shop/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "productId": 1,
    "quantity": 2
}
### Place an order that exceeds available stock (expect 400)
POST http://localhost:8090/shop/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "productId": 5,
    "quantity": 9999
}
### List all placed orders
GET http://localhost:8090/shop/orders